      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Training 5 — External API Call\n\n**Nodes:** Webhook · HTTP Request · Code · Respond\n\n**Flow:** take `postcode` → call free postcodes.io API (no key) → reshape in Code → reply\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 Test 1 — Valid postcode ✅\n\n```json\n{ \"postcode\": \"SW1A 2AA\" }\n```\n\n### 🧪 Test 2 — Invalid postcode ❌\n\n```json\n{ \"postcode\": \"ABC123\" }\n```\n\n**Expect:** London / Westminster, or `{ \"valid\": false }`",
